-- p(Q, Y) :- h(X, Z), l(X, Y), trig(Y, Z, Q) over 40 + 40 + 10 rows, under a budget of 75 that
-- runs out inside the firing: the world holes budget_exhausted and holds the conclusions that came
-- before the cut. Which they are is the engine's (the plan concludes in its own order, and the cut
-- moves as the engine improves), so the world is Rust's alone.
